<title>USA: Regents of the University of Colorado repriced.</title>
<headline>Regents of the University of Colorado repriced.</headline>
<text>
<p>THE REGENTS OF THE UNIVERSITY OF COLORADO</p>
<p>RE: $40,445,000*</p>
<p>MASTER LEASE PURCHASE AGREEMENT REFUNDING</p>
<p>CERTIFICATES OF PARTICIPATION (TELECOMMUNICATIONS</p>
<p>AND COGENERATION PROJECTS) SERIES 1996</p>
<p>WE HAVE RECEIVED THE VERBAL AWARD.</p>
<p>    MOODY'S: Aaa / A2	    S&amp;P: AAA / A</p>
<p>AMBAC INSURED (EXCEPT 1997 MATURITY WHICH IS UNINSURED AND RATED A2/A)</p>
<p>DATED: 11/01/1996	  FIRST COUPON: 06/01/1997</p>
<p>DUE: 12/01</p>
<p> MATURITY		AMOUNT*    COUPON	   PRICE</p>
<p>12/01/1997**	    4,710M    4.50  %	  4.00</p>
<p>					  (Approx. $ Price 100.497)</p>
